Andros Anthropos is a ten-foot-tall human man who introduces himself as a totally normal human man. He is a doctor and a guardian, wears heavy armor, and carries a clockwork shield. He has darkvision.

He travelled with [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Cedric Corot|Cedric Corot]] and [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Krod Snodman|Krod Snodman]] into the [[Verdant Expanse]], treated the injuries of the boy [[People/Tommy Lagerman|Tommy Lagerman]], and took a charcoal etching of the half-tree carving left on the door of Cedric's magical mansion.
